# API / schemas (Cursor adapter)

1. Read `packages/api/AGENTS.md` (and root `AGENTS.md` / `SECURITY.md`).
2. Zod contracts live in `@safrs/schemas`; DB access stays in `@safrs/database`.
3. Preserve correlation-ID error envelopes; no stacks, DB URLs, or secrets in responses.
4. Shared API/schema/dependency changes are R2.
5. Verify: `pnpm --filter @safrs/api test` and `pnpm --filter @safrs/api typecheck`.
